---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="广告合作 - CryptoNav">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">广告合作</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mb-8">在 CryptoNav 展示你的项目，触达精准的加密货币用户群体</p>

    <!-- Ad Slots -->
    <div class="space-y-6 mb-12">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <!-- Home Banner -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 p-6">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">首页 Banner</h3>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 text-xs font-medium rounded bg-accent-500/10 text-accent-600 dark:text-accent-400">热门</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-surface-400 mb-3">首页最显眼位置，1920x300，支持图片/HTML5</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">¥3,000</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-surface-400">/月</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Top -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-3">侧栏广告（顶部）</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-surface-400 mb-3">分类页侧栏顶部，300x250，跟随滚动</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">¥1,500</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-surface-400">/月</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar Bottom -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-3">侧栏广告（底部）</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-surface-400 mb-3">分类页侧栏底部，300x250 或 300x600</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">¥1,000</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-surface-400">/月</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Inline Card -->
        <div class="bg-white dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl border border-surface-200 dark:border-surface-700 p-6">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-3">内嵌广告卡片</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-surface-400 mb-3">项目列表中插入，视觉与项目卡片一致</p>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-1">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100">¥800</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-surface-400">/月</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Sponsored Listing -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-600 to-brand-700 rounded-xl p-6 text-white">
        <div class="flex items-start justify-between flex-wrap gap-4">
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg mb-1">赞助收录 / 置顶推荐</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-brand-100 mb-3">让你的项目在首页精选推荐区展示，获得更多曝光</p>
            <ul class="text-xs text-brand-100 space-y-1">
              <li>首页精选轮播展示（带"赞助"标识）</li>
              <li>对应分类页置顶</li>
              <li>搜索结果优先排名</li>
              <li>可附推荐语 + 联盟链接</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold">¥5,000</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-brand-200">/月</div>
            <a href="mailto:advertise@cryptonav.com" class="inline-block mt-3 bg-white/20 hover:bg-white/30 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition-colors">联系合作</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contact -->
    <div class="bg-surface-50 dark:bg-surface-800 rounded-xl p-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-bold text-surface-800 dark:text-surface-100 mb-2">联系我们</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-surface-500 dark:text-surface-400 mb-4">填写下方表单或直接邮件联系，我们将在 24 小时内回复</p>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-4 text-sm">
        <a href="mailto:advertise@cryptonav.com" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">advertise@cryptonav.com</a>
        <span class="text-surface-300">|</span>
        <a href="https://t.me/cryptonav" class="text-brand-600 dark:text-brand-400 hover:underline">@cryptonav</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
